  "description": "JWT, JWS, JWE and JWK library for .NET built on the platform's own cryptography, with no dependency on Microsoft.IdentityModel. Sign, encrypt and validate tokens, manage JSON Web Keys, and keep signing keys in HashiCorp Vault, OpenBao or Azure Key Vault.",
  "iconFile": "Abblix.png",
  "id": "Abblix.JWT",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-09-05T11:16:24.973Z",
